<title>USA: Century Aluminum raises plate prices 5 pct.</title>
<headline>Century Aluminum raises plate prices 5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>RAVENSWOOD, W.Va. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Century Aluminum on Wednesday said it would increase the prices of its aluminum plate products by five percent, effective June 18.</p>
<p>The price will also apply to all orders scheduled to be shipped after January 1, 1998, regardless of order entry date.</p>
<p>The company said the increase was being made by eliminating a market discount or by increasing net transaction prices.</p>
</text>
